Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:03.56,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&H526A85&\fad(446,429)\pos(507,322)}Episode 8 "A Gift \NMore Lovely Than Jewels"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:07.67,Default,woman,0,0,0,,Freshly caught today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:11.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Kyros, may I look at that stall, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.35,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:16.45,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,These spices are for Toppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:19.79,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,These flower seeds are for Johan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.17,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This bracelet is lovely, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:28.19,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,These are all gifts for \Neveryone back at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Well, it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:32.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And you can't really say anything \Nabout anyone else, Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:36.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,All you've bought are gifts for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:40.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Looks like we should stop by the carriage \Nto drop things off, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:41.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:17.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Is this... the artisans quarter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:19.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,This shop is a purveyor to the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I've agreed to meet Luiphon here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.99,0:02:31.99,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,Thank you for visiting our shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:34.12,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,Count Granado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:37.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Giovanni! It's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:38.73,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is Luiphon here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:41.08,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,Yes, he's on the second floor taking a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:43.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,He summons me here, then takes a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:48.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, please wait here for me. \NHe's got a habit of sleeping naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:50.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:55.71,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,They must process precious \Nstones at this shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:00.90,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder what these are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.34,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,These are fragments produced during \Nthe design-cutting process.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.25,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,They come from high quality jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:08.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Really? They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:12.67,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,If you thread them, they can also \Nbe used to make modest accessories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:17.77,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,As you are the count's guest, we'll happily \Ngift you as many as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:18.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:23.63,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,All I did was follow Lord Kyros here, \Nand he'll give them to me for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:31.56,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What a beautiful green.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:42.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-If I were to buy these, \Nhow much would they cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:43.79,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.37,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:48.28,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,Something close to this amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:52.70,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,They aren't inexpensive, but at this price...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:58.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'll take these, please.\NAnd I will, of course, pay for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:01.22,Default,Giovanni,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:11.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I've hardly ever even touched any jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:15.31,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I never imagined I'd buy any myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:18.60,Default,Luiphon in disguise,0,0,0,,Why hello, Miss! Have you bought \Nyourself something nice there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.17,0:04:22.95,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What? Could this be that \N"being picked up" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:27.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But I'm here with someone, \Nso if you'll excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:32.37,Default,Luiphon in disguise,0,0,0,,What? What is this person \Nlike? Is he handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:35.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,H-He's wonderful! Very much so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:38.04,Default,Luiphon in disguise,0,0,0,,In what way? His looks? His \Npersonality? Do you share interests?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:40.20,Default,Luiphon in disguise,0,0,0,,Have you kissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:42.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,H-His looks and personality \Nare both wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,We share interests, \Nand he's a wonderful fiancé!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.71,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And as for kissing, we are \Nlikely to do so very soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? L-Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:53.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\an7\shad0\fs24\c&H9E85E6&\3c&HFFFBFF&}Death \Nby Cuteness...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:52.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:58.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And you, Luiphon! Weren't you \Nnapping on the second floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:05:00.55,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Hey, my dear Marie! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:01.93,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It's me, Prince Luiphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:04.36,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,O-Once again, this man has...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:05.86,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:09.86,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I know it's sudden, but let's finish up \Nthe business that I called you here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.19,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,This is in celebration of your betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.56,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,A ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.55,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No. A pink diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:21.14,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,But it's very red for one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:24.08,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It's an incredibly rare red diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:27.39,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Search the world and you won't \Nfind another of this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:28.94,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:30.88,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It must be a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.49,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:36.39,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,During the war, this rare item was used to\N negotiate alliances with other nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:40.57,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Though ever since then, it has \Nslept in the royal palace treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:44.74,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You can have it for eighty million euiro. \NI'll give you a friends discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.19,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You're telling me to buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:50.30,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I convinced all those strait-laced old men \Nin a meeting of the royal family, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:53.31,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I said, "If any of us royals were to wear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:56.45,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,our people would say to stop \Nwasting their taxes and revolt."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:58.90,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:05.08,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Though if I said it was a gift for Count \NGranado, no one would be able to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:11.34,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Sweet Marie, the Granado family's wealth \Ncurrently exceeds that of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:15.72,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,The highway that the then \NMargrave Granado laid down...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:20.10,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,The checkpoints and harbor he built \Nto collect taxes from the merchants...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:23.46,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Duchess Liu Liu and Kyros' \Nskillful mercantile abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:28.36,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That's how the House of Granado \Nobtained their immense wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:32.36,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,These days, nobility alone \Ndoesn't guarantee a life of ease.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:37.49,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,If they can't change with the times, even the \Nmost distinguished families will quickly fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:40.87,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Like Baron Shaderan's family did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.79,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,He doesn't mean that as a slight towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:50.37,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Wealth is a weapon. One used to protect \None's people and other precious things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:56.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, and as a member of the House of Granado,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:59.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I will be diligent about \Nnever neglecting my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:01.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.96,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I'll make it 70 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.65,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Dear Kyros, you have been \Nsearching, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:14.54,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,For a gem that matches the color of her \Nhair, the most beautiful jewel in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I wanted it to be a surprise \Nfor the betrothal ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:23.53,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's just that the distinct charm\N of this color is so unique...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I thought of you right away.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.96,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Does he mean the color of my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:33.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But it's usually something \Nthat people disdain and avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:40.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Thank you, Luiphon, for searching out \Nsomething so perfectly suited to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:46.44,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:50.42,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But it'll still take a few \Ndays to turn it into a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:58.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you for before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:03.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,When I heard that you'd been looking \Nfor a gem the color of my hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.66,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,it made me very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:10.28,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I hoped it might delight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:15.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I thought that your kindness was simply \Nyou being considerate towards me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:17.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,so I've always shied away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:21.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But now, I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This is a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:32.48,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,When I was picking out presents for \Neveryone, I secretly bought this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:35.89,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Will you accept it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,As long as it isn't an imposition!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:53.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It looks good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.88,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You look quite dashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.43,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And, actually, I also have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:05.14,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Emerald fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:10.53,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I thought that it might look nice if \NI sewed them on the ends like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:12.66,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And the last one is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.85,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You like emeralds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:20.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's only that I thought they \Nmatched the color of your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:22.37,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,My eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.92,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The moment I thought \Nthey looked like his eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:29.05,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I suddenly wanted those fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:33.11,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I dearly wanted to make them my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:39.22,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's a little hot, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm going to open the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:54.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:10:01.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What happened? Did something \Nout there cause you concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:03.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:05.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wasn't thinking properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:12.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Today, I was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Because you held my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:18.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I've always had a complex about \Nmy large, unlovely hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:21.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your hands are charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:25.35,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I like holding hands with you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:28.93,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I like it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.50,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If it's only my hands that you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,then please, push me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:41.75,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:45.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.63,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Then trade places with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.97,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:04.68,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Why are you there? That spot belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.98,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Trade places with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.68,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Trade places!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:20.31,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.02,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This is how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:28.07,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,So then, why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:31.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Why do I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,so cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:37.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,M-Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,P-Please stop the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:47.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No! To a doctor, immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:51.43,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's cold. So cold... it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.44,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.35,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.27,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:01.60,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm right here, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:05.27,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,How's that? Does it feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:08.62,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.16,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,It's all right. It's just \Na cold in your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:14.93,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,They said that if you sleep \Na lot, you'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.69,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Where are Mama and Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.46,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,They both said they're busy with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.89,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,That's why your big sister's \Ngoing to read you a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:28.38,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,It's your favorite, Marie! \N"The Raggedy Red Cat"!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:33.14,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"Some other time in some other place,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:36.62,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"a raggedy red cat lived in a town."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:40.35,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"Say, little cat, what's your name?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:44.50,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"None of your business, you idiot! \NWhy would I have a name anyway?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.49,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"I'm just a raggedy old cat!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:50.43,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"Don't you wanna know why I'm raggedy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:54.40,Flashback,Young Marie,0,0,0,,"I know why. It's because you're red, right?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:58.59,Flashback,Young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"You should go on a journey, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:01.83,Flashback,Young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"If a cat lies around like \Ntrash, it becomes trash."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:04.54,Flashback,Young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"If trash meows like a cat, \Nthen it becomes a cat."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:05.84,Flashback,Young Anastasia,0,0,0,,"And..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:08.27,Flashback,young Anastasia; young Marie,0,0,0,,"if that cat goes traveling,\Nthen it becomes a traveling cat!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:14.32,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:18.01,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,I told you not to enter \NMarie's room, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:19.89,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,You don't listen no matter how \Nmany times you're told, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.89,0:13:21.89,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Grandmother Sasha...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:26.20,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm her big sister, so I \Nhave to make Marie better!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:28.53,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,This nonsense won't make \Nher better, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:32.08,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,And your translation is entirely incompetent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.58,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Learning it properly is \Nfor Marie's sake as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.42,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.21,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:40.83,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:44.63,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Forget what Anastasia has \Nread you from this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:46.63,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,You will learn it just as it is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:49.46,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Is it time for lessons?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.70,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,My body still isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:57.13,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,You are the smartest of \Neveryone in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:14:00.47,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,That's why educating you is \Nthe most efficient choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:04.74,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,But Sister says she likes \Nwords from Ipsandros, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.49,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:09.74,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,You will recite this and learn Ipsian \Nwhile you are still four years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.15,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,And you will master Flarian \Nbefore you turn six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:15.57,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:20.13,Flashback Italics,young Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I love this story from Ipsandros, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:26.01,Flashback Italics,young Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's cold. It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.62,Flashback Italics,young Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Sister, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:33.55,Flashback Italics,young Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Sister... help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:43.24,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:46.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you awake, Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:49.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Why am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.98,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You collapsed with a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:53.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The doctor said it's likely from exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:54.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:15:00.16,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself yet. You were \Ngroaning so much in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:05.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:09.04,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The napping room in the castle. \NIt's the closest one to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:10.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh, and please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:14.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I left changing your clothes and wiping \Nyour sweat to the maids and left the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.69,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I swear to you that I also did \Nnot sneak under the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:20.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't worried about any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:25.31,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thanks to everyone's help,\NI think my fever has gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,How long have I been...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:32.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You've slept for nearly half \Na day. It's almost dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:37.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... Lord Kyros,\Ndoes this mean you haven't slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:39.66,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You looked after me all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:45.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I couldn't have slept for worrying \Nanyway. Don't let it trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.07,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:51.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, this soup is very nourishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:52.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It isn't bitter at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.75,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I could eat it even if it was bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.89,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This brings back memories \Nfrom when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:03.97,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Your big sister will feed \Nyou! Now, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:05.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.56,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry! It isn't what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A long time ago, my sister \Nlooked after me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.69,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your sister looked after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:27.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, but that was when we were very little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:33.80,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Now that he mentions it,\Nwhen did I start eating alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:37.83,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Was it after Grandmother Sasha passed away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:39.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is the soup not enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.87,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,There's some biscuit cookies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:44.26,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Biscuit cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.68,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Ever since Grandmother died,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:52.11,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Mother started treating me as \Nthough I were no more than smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.42,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie! You must be hungry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:02.24,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,I brought you some biscuit cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:06.61,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,I can't. Mama said I \Ncan't eat anything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:10.17,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,It's because I got taller again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.05,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Don't worry about any of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:17.76,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.44,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:35.94,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:41.49,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,My beautiful, kind older sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:46.60,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,If she had lived, then instead of \Nsomeone like me, Lord Kyros would...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:49.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'll go fetch the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:50.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:53.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:56.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I beg of you, stay here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:59.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:02.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll come right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:04.81,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Has being sick made you feel forlorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:13.05,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I just don't want to be apart \Nfrom you for even a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:19.33,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If you're doing this out of gratitude \Nfor my nursing you, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:24.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,How could my selfishness \Nserve as thanks towards you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:25.40,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:29.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,you keep saying things that make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:37.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,When did I start being able to \Nlook him in the eye like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:43.05,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Even when I never lifted my gaze, \Nhe was always watching over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:56.15,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I love your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:19:00.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Before, when you were kind \Nto me, it made me hesitate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:04.15,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,but now... it only makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:09.54,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm going to be filled to the brim \Nwith this feeling of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:16.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I... love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:18.89,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:34.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:40.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,From the first moment I \Nmet you, I've loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:44.90,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Once, I would have rejected \Nthose words, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:48.71,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.81,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I think I may cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:20:01.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I am delighted that my love is reciprocated,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:05.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,but also, that you're saying these \Nthings to me of your own accord...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.03,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,nothing could possibly make me happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:13.39,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I have to tell the doctor that you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:17.20,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'll come right back, so please \Nstay there in bed and wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,In bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:23.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(151,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H7D5CCA&\bord0\b1\fs20\pos(454,116)}In bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:23.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(151,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H7D5CCA&\bord0\b1\fs15\pos(421,169)}In bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:23.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(151,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H7D5CCA&\bord0\b1\fs12\pos(402,214)}In bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.18,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'll wait right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I-I didn't mean it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:28.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? Oh, I'm sorry! I jumped to conclusions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:30.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one who's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:31.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Well, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:47.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:50.76,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:53.47,Default Top,Mio,0,0,0,,He was skipping and missed \Na step on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:56.38,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Honestly. What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio! Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.35,0:21:03.23,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I've just returned. There is a small \Nbut urgent matter to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:04.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:05.52,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.65,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I've brought a guest to the reception hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:15.40,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Is it really all right for me to come, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:21.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It won't be pleasant, but it's something \Nyou should hear with your own ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:25.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It concerns a member of your \Nfamily, Anastasia Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:36.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:44.69,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This is the current lord, Kyros Granado.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:47.58,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Raise your head, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.86,0:21:57.50,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This man... was the driver of the \Ncarriage that Lady Anastasia rode in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:02.08,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The one where my sister died in an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:04.41,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Jacob...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:08.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I hear that you came here years ago from the \NBandelee Islands in order to earn money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:18.27,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:21.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Did you kill Anastasia Shaderan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:01.97,Default Top,Johan,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I became \Nthe Granado Castle huntsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:05.11,Default Top,Johan,0,0,0,,but I never imagined I'd be charged \Nwith a duty like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:09.39,Default Top,Johan,0,0,0,,Next time, "In Pursuit \Nof Anastasia's Spirit."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:12.08,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(438,1)\pos(487,319)}Episode 9 "In Pursuit \Nof Anastasia's Spirit"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:11.79,Default Top,Johan,0,0,0,,Don't miss it.
